ts","r":"management","s":"Bill Clancy","x":"Our adjusted operating margin of 4.8% which excluded start-up and restructuring costs amounting to $885,000 improved from 1.1% in 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/vishay-precision-vpg-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2025 Q2","e":"vpg","d":"2025-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bill Clancy","x":"On an adjusted basis, 2025 SG and A was approximately $27.1 million or 36% of sales excluding approximately $500,000 of severance costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/vishay-precision-vpg-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2025 Q3","e":"vpg","d":"2025-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ziv Shoshani","x":"We successfully mitigated the impact of tariff costs through a price adjustment to our customers and do not believe tariffs impacted demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/04/vishay-precision-vpg-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2025 Q3","e":"vpg","d":"2025-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ziv Shoshani","x":"The third quarter gross margin was impacted by $600,000 of unfavorable foreign exchange and $800,000 from unfavorable product mix, which offset higher volume and tariff-related net price adjustments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/04/vishay-precision-vpg-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2025 Q3","e":"vpg","d":"2025-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ziv Shoshani","x":"Our adjusted operating margin was 6.2%, which excluded startup costs, restructuring costs, and purchase accounting adjustments amounting to $162,000 and the gain on the sale of a building of $5.5 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/04/vishay-precision-vpg-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2025 Q3","e":"vpg","d":"2025-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ziv Shoshani","x":"We continued to improve our operating margin, which reflects our cost reduction and efficiency program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/04/vishay-precision-vpg-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2025 Q4","e":"vpg","d":"2026-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ziv Shoshani","x":"This new customer is an emerging robotics company developing humanoids to enhance productivity and streamline daily operations in both homes and warehouse environments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/vishay-precision-vpg-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2025 Q4","e":"vpg","d":"2026-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ziv Shoshani","x":"As a result of the new organization, we expect $2 million in savings to cost reduction initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/vishay-precision-vpg-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2026 Q1","e":"vpg","d":"2026-05-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ziv Shoshani","x":"Supporting the build out of AI data centers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/12/vpg-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2026 Q1","e":"vpg","d":"2026-05-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ziv Shoshani","x":"With sensors, we saw particularly robust demand related to AI infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/12/vpg-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2026 Q1","e":"vpg","d":"2026-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ziv Shoshani","x":"And we continue to implement additional cost reduction programs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/12/vpg-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2026 Q1","e":"vpg","d":"2026-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ziv Shoshani","x":"Adjusted for $449 thousand of restructuring costs $837 thousand of stock based compensation, adjusted operating margin was 1.9%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/12/vpg-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2026 Q2","e":"vpg","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ziv Shoshani","x":"Demand continued to be driven by investments in AI-related infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/vishay-precision-group-vpg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2026 Q2","e":"vpg","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ziv Shoshani","x":"A core part of our strategy is increasing our exposure to attractive secular growth markets, including semiconductor equipment, AI infrastructure, fiber optics communication, aerospace and defense.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/vishay-precision-group-vpg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2026 Q2","e":"vpg","d":"2026-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"William Clancy","x":"This assumes constant second fiscal quarter 2026 exchange rates and excludes expected third quarter tariff refunds to customers, which are profit neutral.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/vishay-precision-group-vpg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2026 Q2","e":"vpg","d":"2026-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Josh Nichols","x":"I know it wouldn't be an impact to profit but just the cash balance, like could you quantify what you expected back in terms of like tariffs -- tariff reimbursement?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/vishay-precision-group-vpg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2026 Q2","e":"vpg","d":"2026-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ziv Shoshani","x":"And I would say, given the fact that we -- beyond our contracts, we already started to put in place a few months ago, price increases in some selective product lines and products, which I believe we should start seeing the benefits in the P&L in the second half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/vishay-precision-group-vpg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2026 Q2","e":"vpg","d":"2026-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ziv Shoshani","x":"Any price increases, we would be able to place only with new orders, not with existing backlog.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/vishay-precision-group-vpg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2026 Q2","e":"vpg","d":"2026-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ziv Shoshani","x":"We generated nearly $1 million of cost savings during the second quarter and remained on track to achieve approximately $6 million of savings this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/vishay-precision-group-vpg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2026 Q2","e":"vpg","d":"2026-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Clancy","x":"Adjusted for restructuring costs, stock-based compensation and severance costs, adjusted operating margin was a positive 1.7%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/vishay-precision-group-vpg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2026 Q3","e":"vpg","d":"2026-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ziv Shoshani","x":"Adjusted orders of $103 million were driven by continued record demand in our Sensors segment from AI-related markets, including semiconductor equipment, data center infrastructure, as well as aerospace and defense applications.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/vishay-precision-vpg-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2026 Q3","e":"vpg","d":"2026-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ziv Shoshani","x":"Demand continued to be driven by investments in AI-related infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/vishay-precision-vpg-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2026 Q3","e":"vpg","d":"2026-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ziv Shoshani","x":"Turning to our Weighing Solutions segment, third quarter adjusted revenue of $26.9 million, which exclude $2.3 million of tariff refunds to customers, declined 11% from the second quarter and were down 2% from a year ago.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/vishay-precision-vpg-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2026 Q3","e":"vpg","d":"2026-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bill Clancy","x":"Referring to slide nine and the reconciliation tables in the slide deck, third quarter of 2026 GAAP net revenues was $85.1 million after $2.3 million of tariff refunds passed through to customers with no impact on gross margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/vishay-precision-vpg-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2026 Q3","e":"vpg","d":"2026-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ziv Shoshani","x":"Regarding our operational improvement initiatives, we delivered nearly $4.2 million of cost savings year to date and remain on track to achieve approximately $6 million of savings this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/vishay-precision-vpg-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VPG 2026 Q3","e":"vpg","d":"2026-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ziv Shoshani","x":"These actions represent the first phase of our three-year plan to deliver approximately $20 million of cost reduction initiatives through manufacturing footprint optimization, increased automation, and procurement efficiencies across our global supply chain.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/vishay-precision-vpg-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[62,1,3349,0,0,0,3251,0],[63,1,2854,0,0,0,2260,436],[64,1,3851,0,0,0,3080,486],[65,1,4710,0,0,0,4161,0],[66,1,4011,0,0,0,3373,444],[67,1,3576,0,0,0,2626,608]],"cinema":[[62,1,3349,0,0,0,3251,0],[63,1,2854,0,0,0,2260,436],[64,1,3851,0,0,0,3080,486],[65,1,4710,0,0,0,4161,0],[66,1,4011,0,